level. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn5le05ob05re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "  Comparatives", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " You use the comparative form to compare two things.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "The comparative form ends in -er: taller<br /> The word more is used with longer words: <span class=\"italic\">more beautiful</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can use the comparative with a noun:  <span class=\"italic\">a bigger car, his car was older</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can use the comparative with than: <span class=\"italic\">his house is larger than my house, this dress is more expensive than that one</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "It's cleaner and newer than I expected. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "It's more beautiful than most Ottoman Mosques!  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "The spices are far less expensive here.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "The carpets are cheaper here too!", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "mosque ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a building for Islamic religious celebrations ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We want to visit the beautiful mosque.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le05ob05aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to talk about Istanbul.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "bazaar", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an open market where people sell things ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I will go shopping at the bazaar today.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le05ob05aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "carpet", "type": "name"}, {"content": "thick, woven material to cover floors ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I will buy a carpet at the market.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le05ob05aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to launch", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to send something out ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The ship is ready to launch.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le05ob05aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "ruins ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "buildings that are falling down ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Do you want to visit the castle ruins?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le05ob05aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Describe a market you went to sometime in the past.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write 6-7 sentences about what you saw there and  bought there.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your sentences to a partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Listen to your partner's sentences.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I describe a market and things in it.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write 50-75 words about what I saw and bought.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I say my sentences aloud.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I listen to my partner speak.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn5le05ob05re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn5le05ob05re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Hey Vanessa!</br>\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Where are you now?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Istanbul!  It's cleaner and newer than I expected.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: What are you going to do there?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: I think l'll go to a Turkish bath later today.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: What about tomorrow?"}, {"image": "engenn5le05ob05re2img01.jpg", "time": "16900", "id": 2, "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: I think I'll visit S\u00fcleymaniye Mosque. It is one of the more beautiful Ottoman Mosques! <br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: What else? <br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Maybe tomorrow I'll check out the bazaar. I hear the spices are far less expensive here. I'll get you some! <br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Look at the carpets too!<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: If I see one, I'll bargain for a better price like the locals do, and pick up one for you!"}, {"image": "engenn5le05ob05re2img07.jpg", "time": "39000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Will you go to Troy?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yes, I'll take the day trip. I'll walk around the ruins and think of Helen.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: The face that launched 1000 ships? Cool!"}], "audiosrc": "engenn5le05ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le05ob05re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 2}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "text", "contents": [{"value": "<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Hey Vanessa!</br>\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Where are you now?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Istanbul!  It's cleaner and newer than I expected.<br />\n<span class =\"stron